  Hypothesis Hfs : (0x6c0000 <= fs)%Z /\ (fs + 4096 + 32768 + 11 * 2 ^ 20 < 2 ^ 47)%Z /\ (fs + 4096 + 32768 + 11 * 2 ^ 20 <= t - 160 \/ t <= fs)%Z.
  Hypothesis Hsp : (0 <= sparg < 2 ^ 64)%Z /\ (0 <= bot < 2 ^ 64)%Z.
